    "4.2",
    "File created by IconPackager, a program used to create Windows icons; contains a raw theme for an icon package, including which packaged icons map to which Windows icons; used to save and load IconPackager themes. ICONPACKAGE files are bundled with several.ICO files or a single.ICL file. They can also be included inside compressed IconPackager.IP files. NOTE: IconPackager introduced the .iconpackage file extension for raw themes beginning with IconPackager 5. Previously, raw themes used the.IPTHEME extension. Windows Stardock IconPackager.",
