    "TI-83 and TI-84 Plus Operating System File",
    "3.6",
    "File used by the Texas Instruments TI-83 and TI-84 Plus advanced math and science graphing calculators; contains files that operate the calculator; provides periodic updates to the operating system of TI-83 and TI-84 Plus calculators. Windows Texas Instruments TI Connect. Texas Instruments TI Connect CE. Texas Instruments TI-GRAPH LINK TiLP2. Mac Texas Instruments TI Connect. Texas Instruments TI Connect CE. Texas Instruments TI-GRAPH LINK TiLP2. Linux Texas Instruments TI Connect CE. TiLP2Free.",
