    ".MYDOCS",
    "Send To My Documents",
    "3.2",
    "Enables the Send To→My Documents option when right-clicking a file or folder in Windows; transfers the selected file to your My Documents folder. Windows Microsoft Windows.",
    "Windows Microsoft Windows.",
