    "IconPackager Raw Theme File",
    "2.5",
    "File used by IconPackager, a program that allows users to create Windows icons; contains settings for an icon theme, including which packaged icons map to which Windows icons; used to save and load IconPackager themes. IPTHEME files were replaced by newer.ICONPACKAGE files beginning with IconPackager version 5. Windows Stardock IconPackager.",
    "Windows Stardock IconPackager.",
